Description: 4k intro by Faemiyah, released in 2017
 Primordial Soup is a 4k intro by Faemiyah (code by Trilkk, synth and music
 by Juippi), 1st at the Assembly 2017 combined 4k intro compo.
 .
 This is the non-compo build, compiled from the sources: shaders and music
 are loaded from files instead of being packed and generated at runtime.

Package: primordialsoup-by-faemiyah-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for primordialsoup-by-faemiyah
 Shaders and precalculated music (FLAC) used by the non-compo build of
 Primordial Soup, a 4k intro by Faemiyah.
